                                     "geography":  "Plano, Illinois, USA",
                                     "summary":  "Mies van der Rohe\u0027s steel-and-glass weekend house for Edith Farnsworth was completed in 1951 beside the Fox River in Plano, Illinois.",
                                     "projectBrief":  "Designed by Ludwig Mies van der Rohe for Dr. Edith Farnsworth as a weekend retreat, the house is elevated above the Fox River floodplain and organized as a minimal steel-and-glass pavilion. Horizontal roof, floor and terrace planes are carried by slender steel columns, while a compact service core preserves an open interior and continuous visual relationship with the surrounding landscape."
